	)
	(text_box "TCAN1044AV: 5 V bus supply, 3V3 logic (VIO). STB tied low = always in normal mode.\nBus pins are +-58 V fault tolerant and IEC ESD rated: no external TVS fitted.\nTermination: 120R to TERM_H; the TERM switch on the root sheet closes TERM_H to CANL.\nHeader: 1 = CANH, 2 = CANL, 3 = GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 139.7 0)
		(size 99.06 11.43)
